
Training Dataset:
ADNI

Architecture:
SMR-Net

Components:

* Multi-Resolution Learning (MRL)
* Cross-Resolution Attention Fusion (CRAF)
* Slice-Level Attention Aggregation (SLAA)
* Graph-Based Neuroanatomical Reasoning (GNR)
* Group Normalization (GN)

Performance:

* CN vs AD
* MCI vs AD
* CN vs MCI

The checkpoint corresponds to the model achieving the highest validation accuracy during 10-fold cross-validation.

---

### Loading Checkpoint


import torch
from model import SMRNet

model = SMRNet(num_classes=3)

checkpoint = torch.load(
    "checkpoints/smrnet_adni_best.pth",
    map_location="cpu"
)

model.load_state_dict(checkpoint)
model.eval()
```

---

### Checkpoint Contents

The saved checkpoint contains:

* Model weights
* Network parameters

To save:


torch.save(
    model.state_dict(),
    "checkpoints/smrnet_adni_best.pth"
)
```

