### Full Training Checkpoint (Optional)


torch.save({
    'epoch': epoch,
    'model_state_dict': model.state_dict(),
    'optimizer_state_dict': optimizer.state_dict(),
    'best_acc': best_acc
}, 'checkpoints/smrnet_full_checkpoint.pth')
```

This allows training to resume from the last saved epoch.

